{"id":479,"date":"2017-07-10T04:22:54","date_gmt":"2017-07-10T04:22:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/agilewriter.wordpress.com\/?p=479"},"modified":"2021-02-03T05:17:47","modified_gmt":"2021-02-03T05:17:47","slug":"agile-writer-featured-on-local-show","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/2017\/07\/10\/agile-writer-featured-on-local-show\/","title":{"rendered":"Agile Writer featured on local show"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/agilewriter.files.wordpress.com\/2017\/07\/img_0001.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-480 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/agilewriter.files.wordpress.com\/2017\/07\/img_0001.jpg?w=200\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/img_0001.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/img_0001-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/img_0001-683x1024.jpg 683w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/img_0001-768x1152.jpg 768w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/07\/img_0001-1024x1536.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" \/><\/a>Richmond, VA \u2013 Agile Writer Jackie Hunter, a retired teacher and elementary school administrator, will be a special guest on the next broadcast of \u201cLove, Light and Positivity\u201d. Hosted by Richmond personality, Yemaja Jubilee, the television episode will air at 7:30 p.m. on Tuesday, July 11th. Viewers may tune in on local public access channels, Comcast (Channel 95) and Verizon (Channel 36).<\/p>\n<p>\u201cRetirement can be the best phase of your life,\u201d says Jackie Hunter, 66, a retired public middle school administrator, \u201cWhen you want to learn how to do something new, my advice is to research \u2018how-to\u2019 books, and find the people and places you need to learn from.\u201d<\/p>\n<p>A native of Richmond, Hunter decided to write a sci-fi fantasy novel after working 31 years in public education as a math and science teacher. She joined Agile Writers of Richmond, a writer\u2019s club dedicated to helping the beginning writer create a first-draft in six months, and a year later had completed her first manuscript.<\/p>\n<p>Her book, Lost in the Red Hills of Mars, is about a twelve year-old girl who lives in the first human colony on Mars. It will be available as an e-book and in paperback in late-August 2017.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Richmond, VA \u2013 Agile Writer Jackie Hunter, a retired teacher and elementary school administrator, will be a special guest on the next broadcast of \u201cLove, Light and Positivity\u201d. Hosted by Richmond personality, Yemaja Jubilee, the television episode will air at 7:30 p.m. on Tuesday, July 11th. Viewers may tune in on local public access channels, Comcast (Channel 95) and Verizon [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":480,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[40,3],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-479","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-agile-writer-news","category-authors"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/479","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=479"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/479\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":915,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/479\/revisio